    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOI7W0xc7DXmIO",
      "title": "Fix ClickHouse concurrent session error in get_qualified_txs",
      "author": "MSilb7",
      "number": 1794,
      "body": "## Summary\n- Fix `Attempt to execute concurrent queries within the same session` error by creating a new ClickHouse client per thread instead of sharing one across `ThreadPoolExecutor` workers\n- Guard `ch.sample(5)` against empty DataFrames to prevent `ValueError` when all chunks fail\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Trigger the `daily_l2_chain_data_uploads` CI job and verify `get_qualified_txs` completes without concurrent session errors\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/op-analytics",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-12T19:09:37Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-02-12T19:17:39Z",
